  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LISAWE Integrated Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This integrated project responds to four main thematic areas: Climate and Environmental Stewardship (CES), Economic Development and Food Security (EDFS), Gender-based Violence (GBV), and Fighting Inequality (FI), in addition to addressing deficits in Climate-Resilient WASH and Peacebuilding. LISAWE is committed to empowering vulnerable communities, particularly women, girls, youth, and people with disabilities, to live dignified lives in the Lindi Region.</narrative>
  </description>
